      "tool": {
        "name": "plugin_management.search_plugins",
        "title": "search_plugins",
        "description": "Search available plugins when the user explicitly requests a plugin or provider, or when their task would benefit from an external app, account, service, data source, or capability not available through existing tools. Infer relevant plugin intent from the task even when the user does not mention plugins. For example, requests involving email, calendars, messaging, documents, CRM, project management, finance, or analytics may warrant plugin discovery. Search before claiming a service is unavailable, asking for pasted data, or proposing a manual workaround. Use concise provider names, product names, or capability keywords. The results returned by this tool are not exhaustive; if you don't find what the user is asking for, mention that more plugins may be available in the [plugin directory](https://chatgpt.com/plugins).",
